OL,3,GNEWSAHGV and cyclist crash at busy
OL,4,Ajunction
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice and paramedics are at the scene
OL,7,Fof a crash involving a lorry and a
OL,8,Fcyclist in Bromsgrove.
OL,10,FWest Mercia Police said the crash at
OL,11,Fthe junction of New Road and the A38
OL,12,Fremained ongoing on Tuesday afternoon.
OL,14,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said it
OL,15,Fwas called to the scene at 15:34 BST
OL,16,Fand sent an ambulance and a paramedic
OL,17,Fofficer.
OL,19,FBBC journalist Joanne Malin, who lives
OL,20,Fin Bromsgrove, came across the crash at
OL,21,Fabout 16:00: "It was obvious there had
OL,22,Fbeen a serious collision.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
